unit uExample;

{ The drawing somebody sees the first time they run this.

  Generated by examples/make-etch-a-sketch.pas - do not edit this by
  hand, edit that and run it again.  It is the same toy etch-a-sketch
  as examples/etch-a-sketch.hsk, carried inside the program so that a
  portable build is still one file and nothing else.

  Why have one at all: an empty sheet tells somebody nothing about
  what this is for, and the first thing most people do with a drawing
  program is look for something to click.  A toy with a robot on it
  answers both - and every one of its faces is something to push. }

